# datastore/

This crate provides the persistence layer for Udex, exposing an SDK library with abstract datastore traits and PostgreSQL implementations. Includes database migrations, transaction support, connection pooling, and integration test fixtures for reliable schema management and backend verification.

## Dirs

- `benches/` -- Criterion benchmarks for datastore layer performance and connection-pool overhead
- `migrations/` -- SQL migration files for schema initialization and schema evolution
- `src/` -- Core Rust library with traits, error types, PostgreSQL implementation, and test fixtures
- `tests/` -- Integration tests for datastore operations, index lifecycle, and entry-context semantics

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package definition with workspace inheritance, feature flags (postgres, integration_test), and dependency pinning
- `build.rs` -- Build script that forces recompilation when migrations directory changes
- `README.md` -- Architecture overview, data model documentation, table definitions, and schema diagram
